# DeepSeek API confirmation

When a command uses `--deepseek` (DeepSeek paid API), the CLI asks a human to type `YES`.

**Never accept that prompt for the user.** Do not pipe `YES`, automate the prompt, or run the experiment yourself.

Instead, give the user the exact command to run in their own terminal. See root `AGENTS.md`.
